Type: Package
Package: invasiongraph
Title: Community assembly analysis with invasion graphs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sebastian", "Schreiber", role = "aut"),
    person("Josef", "Hofbauer", role = "aut"),
    person("William K.", "Petry", , "wpetry@ncsu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5230-5987"))
  )
Maintainer: William K. Petry <wpetry@ncsu.edu>
Description: Functions for calculating the invasion pathways by which
    communities assemble using the principles of Modern Coexistence
    Theory. The code for the core functions was written by Sebastian
    Schreiber and included as a Supplementary File with Hofbauer &
    Schreiber (2023; doi: 10.48550/arXiv.2204.03773). This package is
    intended to enable easier access to this code.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Imports: 
    ggplot2,
    ggraph,
    igraph,
    matrixcalc,
    tidygraph,
    utils
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
URL: https://github.com/DICELab-NCSU/invasiongraph
BugReports: https://github.com/DICELab-NCSU/invasiongraph/issues
